<h3 id="4-dioxus--react-in-rust">4. Dioxus — React in Rust</h3>

<p>Syntax closely resembles React Hooks and compiles to machine code. One codebase covers Web (WASM), desktop (Blitz self-rendered), mobile, and TUI. Rust’s compile-time type safety; package size ~12MB. Suited to long-term bets on a Rust full stack. Still at v0.6, <strong>not recommended for production use in 2026 for now.</strong></p>

