<h3 id="5-electrobun--electron-with-bun">5. Electrobun — “Electron with Bun”</h3>

<p>Replaces Node.js with Bun and writes the low-level layer in Zig; package size <strong>~12MB</strong>. Very early stage. Keep an eye on it.</p>

