<h3 id="6-tauri-20--3mb--mobile-ga">6. Tauri 2.0 — 3MB + Mobile GA</h3>

<p>Tauri 2.0 was stably released in 2025, with <strong>mobile (iOS/Android) officially GA</strong>. Rust backend + Web frontend + system WebView, with a package size of only 3MB. Suited to a hybrid architecture of frontend teams + Rust inference engines. <strong>No Mini Program/HarmonyOS support.</strong></p>

