</ul>

<blockquote>
  <p>Verdict: only choose this path when local inference performance is the absolute bottleneck (for example, needing 7B+ models to respond in real time on a laptop). 90% of AI Agent scenarios don’t need this level of optimization.</p>
</blockquote>

